  "summary": [
    "FR-006 document search: finding documents relevant to a task given by a user or another skill",
    "Recall-first policy: include uncertain documents and exclude only clearly irrelevant ones",
    "Key handling: --key selects the ToC, and the reserved key all is used when omitted",
    "Behavior when the ToC is not built: return that an initial build is required",
    "Pre-search check of whether a rebuild is needed, with a choice between rebuilding and searching the existing ToC",
    "Target specification file returned with the confirmation so the checked target is the one rebuilt",
    "Rebuild scale shown to the user: counts by change type and the number needing AI summaries",
    "Failure to judge rebuild need stops the search and offers no keep-existing option",
    "Search results contain document ID, path, reason, sections and ToC state",
    "Acceptance criterion AC-019 for the pre-search rebuild confirmation"
